    },
    {
      "fact_text": {
        "text": "The third part covers core Java API useful classes in the standard Java library.",
        "refs": ["Q0003"]
      },
      "fact_type": null
    },
    {
      "fact_text": {
        "text": "The fourth part covers advanced Java features such as streams, threads, and database programming.",
